{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-24","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-24"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-24-talk-403811901-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-24","missionId":"event-rogue-24","mission":"살레오 (1)","scene":"살레오 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"래터닝 행성의 어두컴컴한 모텔에 들어선다. 계단에서 마주친 덩치 큰 손님이 당신을 섬뜩하게 한다——투명하고 끈적한 액체의 몸 위에는 한쪽에는 빨간색 더듬이가, 다른 한쪽에는 하얀색 후광이 달려있는 머리 두 개가 서로 충돌하고 있다","talkId":403811901,"textHash":"1717042315734534411","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:24/talk-403811901","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"d98265572ce56649","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-24-talk-403811902-line"],"bwikiPage":"萨里奥（其一）","bwikiRevision":58255,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9300","bwikiMission":"살레오 (1)"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-24-talk-403811902-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-24","missionId":"event-rogue-24","mission":"살레오 (1)","scene":"살레오 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"무섭게 생긴 이 손님의 두 가지 인격 중에서 반드시 하나를 선택해야 하는 듯하다","talkId":403811902,"textHash":"15613040395161496811","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:24/talk-403811902","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"d98265572ce56649","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"萨里奥（其一）","bwikiRevision":58255,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9300","bwikiMission":"살레오 (1)"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-24-text-3313304563863883564-choice","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-24","missionId":"event-rogue-24","mission":"살레오 (1)","scene":"살레오 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"귀찮은 두 *이웃*을 처치한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"3313304563863883564","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:24/text-3313304563863883564","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"ddbf00681954d102","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiP